see.

28
00:02:25,380 --> 00:02:27,330
So — the difference?

29
00:02:27,330 --> 00:02:32,080
It was never how hard you work. It's what you
work with.

30
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:37,180
Ten credentials. One platform. That's enough.

31
00:02:37,180 --> 00:02:40,260
Certuvo. Your exam partner.
